  "notes": "{取|と}り{残|のこ}す means to leave behind or leave out.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n- Pair: {取|と}り{残|のこ}される (passive/intransitive sense)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {時代|じだい}に{取|と}り{残|のこ}される: to be left behind by the times\n- {社会|しゃかい}から{取|と}り{残|のこ}される: to be excluded from society\n- {一人|ひとり}{取|と}り{残|のこ}される: to be left alone\n\nUSAGE:\nOften used in passive form ({取|と}り{残|のこ}される) to express feeling abandoned or excluded.",
